<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Recon 회원가입</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-light">
<div class="container" style="max-width: 380px; margin-top: 10vh;">
  <h4 class="mb-4 text-center">회원가입</h4>
  {{#hasError}}<div class="alert alert-danger">{{errorMessage}}</div>{{/hasError}}
  <form method="post" action="/signup">
    <input type="hidden" name="{{csrf.parameterName}}" value="{{csrf.token}}">
    <div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">아이디 (영문, 숫자, _ 3~30자)</label><input class="form-control" name="username" value="{{username}}"></div>
    <div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">비밀번호 (8자 이상)</label><input class="form-control" type="password" name="password"></div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary w-100" type="submit">가입</button>
  </form>
  <p class="text-center mt-3"><a href="/login">로그인으로</a></p>
  <p class="text-muted small text-center">가입하면 조회 권한(USER)이 부여됩니다. 관리자(ADMIN)는 서버 설정으로만 만들 수 있습니다.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
